#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create beautiful,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">accessible<br/><span class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>apps."
msgstr "Cruthaigh go hálainn,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">inrochtana<br/><span class=\"platform web\">gréasán</span></span><br/>aipeanna."

#: index.md:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "Múnla aon-thóicín réitithe, athmhúnlaithe i stíleanna-scríofa, bannaí fráma, cód dúchasach agus pacáistí uirlisí dearaidh."

#: index.md:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Tús a chur"

#: index.md:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "Tagairt CSS"

#: index.md:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Tagairt API"

#: index.md:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Foinse amháin na fírinne"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr "Úsáideann gach paicéad na comhéigeanna dearadh oifigiúla Instructure, comhpháirteanna, agus idirbhearta ó <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Úsáid an pacáiste is lú"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Suiteáil ach @pantoken/css le haghaidh stíleála-scríofa, @pantoken/react le haghaidh hooks agus deilbhíní, nó réamhshocrú bundlera do Tailwind, Panda, nó MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Gineann do aon ardán"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr "Suiteáil an cli pantoken chun réamhsocruithe a ghiniúint nó comhpháirteanna a chur leis d'aon ardán&colon; gréasán, dúchasach, agus gach ní eile."

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr "Níl React de dhíth"

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr "Tá an leabharlann InstUI ceangailte go dlúth le React. Más mian leat a úsáid, caithfidh tú React a úsáid. Anois is féidir leat a thógáil áit ar bith."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, i ngach áit"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr "Léann gach pacáiste an IR réitithe céanna do thóicín. Athraigh tóicín sa fhoinse agus sruthóidh sé go CSS, SCSS, cód dúchasach agus Figma ar an mbealach céanna."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr "Rith `pantoken generate` chun Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress agus níos mó a ghiniúint. Na tóicíní céanna, i bhfoclóir gach éiceachórais."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Gan spleáchas upstream"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr "Seoltar na tóicíní mar JSON statach miondíoltóra, mar sin ní théann `npm i` riamh i dtaithí ar fhoinse atá ar GitHub amháin. In-foilseach le semver agus oiriúnach le húsáid as líne."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "An léarscáil phacáiste"
